{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t紀念孫中山先生誕辰160周年大會，上午在北京人民大會堂舉行。<br/>\n<br/>\n央視報道，中共中央總書記、國家主席、中央軍委主席習近平，出席大會並發表重要講話。<br/>\n<br/>\n中共中央政治局常委李強、趙樂際、王滬寧、蔡奇、丁薛祥、李希出席大會。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T02:43:54.920742+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T02:21:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T02:48:09.123546+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T02:37:20.829995+00:00","content_hash":"fb848a37de8d83f8e8673dfc9dbdfef876d894717815dd4119496f2c0678834f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}